    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Off Trail is a procedurally generated infinite downhill skiing game. Land tricks, discover unique biomes, and ski alongside countless creatures. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation</strong> - Explore an infinite downhill mountain with new terrain in every run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique biomes</strong> - Explore unique biomes, from the Andes to the Japanese Alps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazards</strong> - Ski as far as you can on each run, while avoiding trees and  animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>XP system</strong> - Earn XP on each run, allowing you to unlock items and venture further down the mountain </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-night cycle</strong> - Ski through days and nights, taking in the beauty of the sunset and sunrise </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather</strong> - Survive the toughest blizzards and ski through rainy thunderstorms </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog companion</strong> - Feeling lonely on the vast mountain? A dog companion accompanies you on your journey, helping to scare away dangerous predators<br><br><br><br></p></li></ul>",
